        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-047177",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For example, we help our brand partners set up accounts and design their homepage on WeChat official store, and/or WeChat Mini-programs, help to regularly update their accounts with stories relating to their products, activities and brands, and sustain user engagement through community groups.",
        "start_character": 65691,
        "end_character": 65985
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-047177",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-047177-df909dab3415938a",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-047177",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For instance, we offer digital marketing solutions that help the brand partners promote their products and increase their sales on live streaming and short video platforms, such as Douyin and Kuaishou.",
        "start_character": 67092,
        "end_character": 67293
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-047177",
