        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-047177",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-23",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2021, we launched a proprietary intelligent customer service management system called “Service Anywhere,” or S-ANY, to unify workflow dispatching, training and resource management and to improve consumer journey and ultimately to facilitate transactions.",
