        "filing_date": "2026-04-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2025, we developed multiple data models, including “The Competitive Product Benchmarking Model”, “The Consumer Value-added Model”, and “The Five Drivers For Hero Product Model”.",
