        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In April and July 2014, through Shanghai Baozun, we entered into certain contractual arrangements with Shanghai Zunyi and its shareholders under which we gained effective control over the operations of Shanghai Zunyi, which currently provides brand e-commerce service to our brand partners.",
